Z||000007||Monkeyman||01-30-2000||06:02 AM||||I'm confused.  Do you have one (1) 21" tube, or two (2) 1" tubes?  If you have (1) 21" tube, putting it behind the seats on the ledge would look good <B>IF</B> and only if you made something to cover it so the light wouldn't shine inside or on the rear window.  If either of those happen, your vision at night won't be for crap especially in the rain, snow, fog, etc.||||reg||1
